{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/47344","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:52.283653+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Internal reproducer submitted in cl/966991753.","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:56:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/47344#issuecomment-5420796160","id":5420796160,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/47344","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHyx1PM8AAAABQxrJAA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/5420796160/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-08-26T04:56:39Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openxla/xla/issues/comments/5420796160","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194224583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/penumallas1261","id":194224583,"login":"penumallas1261","node_id":"U_kgDOC5Ohxw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/penumallas1261","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"\nThis bug is triggered by the HLO-to-StableHLO conversion: the HLO module runs successfully via `run_hlo_module --input_format=hlo`, and the conversion via `hlo-translate --hlo-to-mlir` also succeeds, but running the translated StableHLO via `run_hlo_module --input_format=stablehlo` fails with: `status_macros.cc:58] INTERNAL: RET_CHECK failure…`. Failure signature: `hlo_input_output_alias_config.cc:220 ShapeUtil::IndexIsValid(…)`.\n\n## Environment\n\n- **CPU**: `Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900HX`\n- **GPU**: `NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU`\n- **CUDA Driver**: `580.126.09`\n- **XLA commit**: `6f1f2d916dcef0428bfa7ea66765be539126c4f2`\n- **StableHLO commit**: `e6f81ebd06b3509f2c7fa6175430aadbd4d724ca`\n\n## HLO module\n\n```\nHloModule CrossingParameters, input_output_alias={ {0}: (0, {0}, may-alias), {1}: (0, {1}, may-alias) }, entry_computation_layout={((f32[], f32[]))->(f32[], f32[])}\n\nENTRY CrossingParameters {\n  _ = (f32[], f32[]) parameter(0)\n  get-tuple-element.1 = f32[] get-tuple-element(_), index=1\n  get-tuple-element = f32[] get-tuple-element(_), index=0\n  ROOT tuple = (f32[], f32[]) tuple(get-tuple-element.1, get-tuple-element)\n}\n```\n\n## Lifted StableHLO IR\n\n```mlir\nmodule @CrossingParameters attributes {mhlo.cross_program_prefetches = [], mhlo.input_output_alias = [{alias = {kind = \"may_alias\", parameter_index = array<i64: 0>, parameter_number = 0 : i64}, output_index = array<i64: 0>}, {alias = {kind = \"may_alias\", parameter_index = array<i64: 1>, parameter_number = 0 : i64}, output_index = array<i64: 1>}], mhlo.is_dynamic = false, mhlo.use_auto_spmd_partitioning = false} {\n  func.func @main(%arg0: tensor<f32>, %arg1: tensor<f32>) -> (tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>) {\n    return %arg1, %arg0 : tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Reproduction (StableHLO run on CPU — failed (rc=255))\n\n**Command:**\n\n```bash\nrun_hlo_module \\\n  --platform=CPU \\\n  --reference_platform= \\\n  --input_format=stablehlo \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.mlir\n```\n\n**Output:**\n\n```\nWARNING: All log messages before absl::InitializeLog() is called are written to STDERR\nE0000 00:00:1786851494.843651 3934847 status_macros.cc:58] INTERNAL: RET_CHECK failure (xla/hlo/ir/hlo_input_output_alias_config.cc:220) ShapeUtil::IndexIsValid(param_shape, alias.parameter_index)\n*** Begin stack trace ***\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t__libc_start_main\n\n*** End stack trace ***\n\n\n ** Running CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.mlir**\nINTERNAL: during context [Unknown]: RET_CHECK failure (xla/hlo/ir/hlo_input_output_alias_config.cc:220) ShapeUtil::IndexIsValid(param_shape, alias.parameter_index)\n\n```\n\n## Reference run (HLO run on CPU — succeeds)\n\n**Command:**\n\n```bash\nrun_hlo_module \\\n  --platform=CPU \\\n  --reference_platform= \\\n  --input_format=hlo \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.hlo\n```\n\n**Output:**\n\n```\n\n ** Running CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.hlo**\nRunning HLO module with runner HloRunner...\n... compiled and ran in 0.00820608s.\nSkipping reference runner\n\n```\n\nThe HLO→StableHLO conversion:\n\n- `hlo-translate` — succeeds\n\n**Command:**\n\n```\nexport XLA_FLAGS='--xla_backend_extra_options=xla_cpu_use_multi_output_fusion --xla_enable_enzyme_comms_opt=true --xla_gpu_async_dot=true --xla_gpu_enable_cudnn_layer_norm=true --xla_gpu_enable_dus_accumulator_zero_init_elimination=true --xla_gpu_enable_latency_hiding_scheduler=true --xla_gpu_enable_scatter_determinism_expander=true --xla_gpu_experimental_stream_annotation=true --xla_gpu_experimental_use_ragged_dot_fusion --xla_gpu_gemm_rewrite_size_threshold=0 --xla_gpu_multi_streamed_windowed_einsum=true --xla_recognize_reduction_optimization_level=1 --xla_reduce_window_rewrite_base_length=1'\nhlo-translate \\\n  --hlo-to-mlir \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.hlo \\\n  -o \\\n  CrossingParameters_8f1b4b9c_61.mlir\n```\n\n## Contact\n\n- **Email**: `ch395@njit.edu, zhihao.yao@njit.edu, benquike@gmail.com`\n","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ope